     1	//! Secure credential custody for Gmail OAuth credentials and verified grants.
     2	//!
     3	//! Production storage is the macOS Keychain via the `keyring` crate
     4	//! (apple-native backend), holding one serialized [`TokenBundle`] under a
     5	//! single account-independent profile key so a restart can authenticate
     6	//! before account discovery. Unsupported platforms fail closed with
     7	//! [`MailError::SecretsUnavailable`]; there is no plaintext fallback.
